                "cardEffectElementDisplays": [],
                "type": "OUTPUT",
                "translations": {
                  "en_US": {
                    "text": "At Noon — If there are three or more cards in your Landmarks, you may sacrifice one. If you do, play for free a Landmark Permanent with a max Hand Cost of {2} more than the sacrificed card.",
                    "locale": "en_US"
                  },
                  "fr_FR": {
                    "text": "(Vous pouvez conserver jusqu'à trois cartes dans vos Repères pendant la Nuit.)",
                    "locale": "fr_FR"
                  },
                  "de_DE": {
                    "text": "Zum Mittag — Falls sich mindestens drei Karten in deinem Wahrzeichen-Bereich befinden, darfst du eine opfern. Falls du das tust, spiele kostenlos eine Bleibende Wahrzeichenkarte mit maximalen Handkosten von {2} mehr als die geopferte Karte.",
                    "locale": "de_DE"
                  },
                  "es_ES": {
                    "text": "Al mediodía — Si hay tres o más cartas en tus hitos, puedes sacrificar una. Si lo haces, juega sin coste un permanente hito con un coste desde la mano máximo de {2} más que la carta sacrificada.",
                    "locale": "es_ES"
                  },
                  "it_IT": {
                    "text": "A mezzogiorno — Se ci sono tre o più carte nei tuoi fulcri, puoi sacrificarne una. Se lo fai, gioca senza pagarne il costo un permanente fulcro con costo dalla mano pari a un massimo di {2} in più della carta sacrificata.",
                    "locale": "it_IT"
                  }
                },
                "text": "At Noon — If there are three or more cards in your Landmarks, you may sacrifice one. If you do, play for free a Landmark Permanent with a max Hand Cost of {2} more than the sacrificed card."
              }
            ],
            "reference": "02080"
          },
          "sequence": 0,
          "id": "01K6X3Y8F89CAZ36823V6HP4PD"
        }
      ],
      "value": "At Noon — If there are three or more cards in your Landmarks, you may sacrifice one. If you do, play for free a Landmark Permanent with a max Hand Cost of {2} more than the sacrificed card.",
